      "message": "After some discussion I think the confusion is that the comments are centered around _on_message() here. I think the case that actually matters is tenant reconfiguration occurs which triggers new subscribe() calls in https://review.opendev.org/c/zuul/zuul/+/994836/12/zuul/driver/mqtt/__init__.py line 67. Given that I\u0027ll keep the flag indicating that the process is the running leader (or not) and set it up to unset in a finally block.\n\nI\u0027ll keep this check here in on_message for symmetry.",
